#ASSERT `reg 46(8)(b) the authority may monitor the auction platform's compliance with regulations 18 to 21 and 24` `the Prudential Regulation Authority` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `reg 46(9) the function is treated as a function conferred on the FCA under FSMA for the purposes of Parts 1, 2 and 4 of Schedule 1ZA` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 46(9) the function is treated as a function conferred on the FCA under FSMA for the purposes of Parts 1, 2 and 4 of Schedule 1ZA` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

