§§ `reg 48 and reg 49`

#ASSERT `reg 48(1) the FCA must give the relevant person guidance on enhanced customer due diligence measures for politically exposed persons` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 48(1) the FCA must give the relevant person guidance on enhanced customer due diligence measures for politically exposed persons` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
