#ASSERT `reg 48(1) the authority must give the relevant person guidance on enhanced customer due diligence measures for politically exposed persons` `the Financial Conduct Authority` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `reg 48(1) the authority must give the relevant person guidance on enhanced customer due diligence measures for politically exposed persons` `the Commissioners for Her Majesty's Revenue and Customs` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
