§§ `reg 52`

-- A body with none of the seven descriptions, and one for each description.  Columns of the record, in order:
--   (a) another supervisory authority, (b) the Treasury, (c) a law enforcement authority (reg 44(10), a MAYBE),
--   (d) an overseas authority, (e) the Secretary of State, (f) the registrar of companies, (g) the investigator
`reg 46 test a body that is none of them`   MEANS `reg 52(5) description of the body` OF FALSE, FALSE, JUST FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`reg 46 test another supervisory authority` MEANS `reg 52(5) description of the body` OF TRUE,  FALSE, JUST FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`reg 46 test the Treasury as a body`        MEANS `reg 52(5) description of the body` OF FALSE, TRUE,  JUST FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`reg 46 test a law enforcement body`        MEANS `reg 52(5) description of the body` OF FALSE, FALSE, JUST TRUE,  FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`reg 46 test an overseas body`              MEANS `reg 52(5) description of the body` OF FALSE, FALSE, JUST FALSE, TRUE,  FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`reg 46 test the Secretary of State`        MEANS `reg 52(5) description of the body` OF FALSE, FALSE, JUST FALSE, FALSE, TRUE,  FALSE, FALSE
`reg 46 test the registrar of companies`    MEANS `reg 52(5) description of the body` OF FALSE, FALSE, JUST FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE,  FALSE
`reg 46 test the complaints investigator`   MEANS `reg 52(5) description of the body` OF FALSE, FALSE, JUST FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE
`reg 46 test a body whose standing as a law enforcement authority is not answered` MEANS `reg 52(5) description of the body` OF FALSE, FALSE, NOTHING, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE

#ASSERT `reg 52(5) the body is a relevant authority` `reg 46 test another supervisory authority` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 52(5) the body is a relevant authority` `reg 46 test the Treasury as a body` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 52(5) the body is a relevant authority` `reg 46 test a law enforcement body` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 52(5) the body is a relevant authority` `reg 46 test an overseas body` EQUALS JUST TRUE
