#ASSERT `reg 52B(3) it is a defence for the accused` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

§§ `The duties as obligations (#TRACE): each prints the outcome in its EXPECT comment`

-- Each rule is an open obligation of the authority named: no time limit is in the text, so
-- the obligation stands until the act is done, and the act done makes FULFILLED.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
